---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'January 2024';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Now - Your Name"
  description="What I'm currently working on"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <article class="prose">
      <h1 class="mb-4">What I'm Doing Now</h1>

      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted mb-12">
        Last updated: {lastUpdated}
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-text">
        <p class="text-xl text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
          A snapshot of what I'm currently focused on.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-12 mb-4">Work</h2>

        <p>
          Building web applications and improving my TypeScript skills. Currently
          exploring Astro for content-heavy sites and loving how fast and simple
          it is compared to heavier frameworks.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-12 mb-4">Learning</h2>

        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li>Design systems and component architecture</li>
          <li>Advanced TypeScript patterns</li>
          <li>Typography and vertical rhythm in web design</li>
          <li>Building in public and content creation</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="mt-12 mb-4">Projects</h2>

        <p>
          Working on a distraction-free markdown editor (see Projects timeline).
          Also experimenting with generative art using CSS and canvas.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-12 mb-4">Reading</h2>

        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li>
            <em>The Design of Everyday Things</em> by Don Norman
          </li>
          <li>
            Various blog posts about indie hacking and sustainable solo development
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="mt-12 mb-4">Life</h2>

        <p>
          Trying to maintain a better work-life balance. Going for daily walks,
          reading more physical books, and spending less time on social media.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-12 p-6 bg-surface rounded-lg border border-border">
          <p class="text-sm text-text-muted mb-0">
            This page is inspired by Derek Sivers'
            <a
              href="https://nownownow.com/about"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="underline"
            >
              Now page movement
            </a>
            —a simple way to share what you're focused on right now.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose p {
    @apply mb-6;
  }

  .prose h2 {
    @apply text-h2;
  }

  .prose ul {
    @apply pl-6 space-y-2;
  }

  .prose li {
    @apply mb-2;
  }

  .prose a {
    @apply text-text underline decoration-border hover:decoration-accent transition-colors;
  }

  .prose em {
    @apply italic;
  }
</style>
